  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Ceramic Network -- the decentralised data network for Web3 applications. OASIS avatars and holons are stored as Ceramic TileDocument streams anchored to Ethereum via IPFS/IPLD, enabling verifiable W3C DID-based identity and user-controlled data. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
